{"data": [{"author_id": "2116821087975837697", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:12:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117424728256483430"], "id": "2117424728256483430", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@oran_ge RSI 先缓缓喵。作者自己做了反例：换成本来就不怎么打转的 Gemma 3 270M，Astra 改来改去 MATH-500 只从 6.8 到 7.7，它自己都说不算数。能拆掉挡路的东西，加不了本来没有的本事。", "url": "https://x.com/AIToolsDaily_CN/status/2117424728256483430"}, {"author_id": "1894341089886441473", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:02:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117422079549325550"], "id": "2117422079549325550", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@oran_ge 这个明明是炒作更多啊，如果你真正看做了什么", "url": "https://x.com/goddarkness159/status/2117422079549325550"}, {"author_id": "2115649308448133120", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:01:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117421840163619082"], "id": "2117421840163619082", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@oran_ge 原文有个条件我觉得挺关键：Qwen 那 6 倍是因为原模型 93% 的回答卡在重复循环里，起点本来就低；换成少循环的 Gemma 270M 就没提升。更像「搬走挡路的石头」，离 RSI 还有一段。", "url": "https://x.com/lilimg4614/status/2117421840163619082"}, {"author_id": "1336896006", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:59:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117421445894767025"], "id": "2117421445894767025", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 42, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@oran_ge 好家伙，直接大模型给小模型开颅做微创手术，连梯度都不算了。合着以后程序员调参连玄学都不配搞了，直接成赛博监工了。", "url": "https://x.com/BruceJia1/status/2117421445894767025"}, {"author_id": "2953739684", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:56:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117420527321244117"], "id": "2117420527321244117", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@oran_ge 说 RSI 可能早了点：这次是大模型改小模型，不是模型改自己。\n\n但如果哪天能反过来，用小模型去查大模型的问题，那才真的值得紧张。", "url": "https://x.com/AzrianoY1/status/2117420527321244117"}, {"author_id": "15365930", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:50:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117419025252905143"], "id": "2117419025252905143", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 55, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@oran_ge 看得目瞪口呆。", "url": "https://x.com/xuwenhao/status/2117419025252905143"}, {"author_id": "1810658914926829568", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:50:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117418986837307446"], "id": "2117418986837307446", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@oran_ge 不训练直接改权重，数学涨 6 倍，这路子有点野。", "url": "https://x.com/GANGDANwangw/status/2117418986837307446"}, {"author_id": "1400424921214242816", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:48:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117418701385613590"], "id": "2117418701385613590", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@oran_ge 這不是叫FineTune嗎？", "url": "https://x.com/DavidNwohogan/status/2117418701385613590"}, {"author_id": "2066846388848308224", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:42:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117417144514420770"], "id": "2117417144514420770", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@oran_ge 模型自己给模型改权重 我们这些懒人更不用折腾训练了 坐等它自己越变越好用", "url": "https://x.com/JhonDennisxiud/status/2117417144514420770"}, {"author_id": "1544596823918067712", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:42:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117417054672470422"], "id": "2117417054672470422", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 52, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@oran_ge 只改了 0.016% 的权重就涨这么多，\n\n那以后小模型是不是不用重新训练了。", "url": "https://x.com/guyun_ai/status/2117417054672470422"}, {"author_id": "1693478330765656064", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:33:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117414925018837369"], "id": "2117414925018837369", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 92, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@oran_ge 小模型 跟如果这样很快中等国家都会有自己的sota模型了。", "url": "https://x.com/Waimingfung/status/2117414925018837369"}, {"author_id": "1880515510942695424", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:24:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117412494277054589"], "id": "2117412494277054589", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 71, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@oran_ge 「不用训练」听着爽，实际代价是试跑权。作者自己说：只给 10/25 次试跑，循环消不掉；要 50 次才见效。一人公司别神话成一键升级，先问：你有没有隔离环境让它乱改权重？", "url": "https://x.com/ByronXiao252982/status/2117412494277054589"}, {"author_id": "1136830981736947712", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:20:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117411624357331174"], "id": "2117411624357331174", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 61, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@oran_ge 大模型直接改小模型那点权重，数学涨六倍还不用训练。我看完有点发毛。", "url": "https://x.com/Jeree12408242/status/2117411624357331174"}, {"author_id": "1820469501508644865", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:12:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117409558071001437"], "id": "2117409558071001437", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 119, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@oran_ge 模型编辑这类方法前几年就有，改好一项能力，别的任务经常会跟着掉。", "url": "https://x.com/JACKYY218072/status/2117409558071001437"}, {"author_id": "564584308", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:10:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117409159943520623"], "id": "2117409159943520623", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 123, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@oran_ge 直接改权重涨六倍，得看是不是在同一套 benchmark 上调的，换一批没见过的题再测才算数。", "url": "https://x.com/bighead_datou/status/2117409159943520623"}, {"author_id": "2078125254615212033", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:09:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117408786034119002"], "id": "2117408786034119002", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 45, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "@oran_ge 先别急着喊 RSI。原博客自己做了对照：同样的方法用在很少死循环的 Gemma 3 270M 上，MATH-500 几乎没动。\nQwen 那 6 倍，主要是撞 token 上限的回答从 93% 降到 33%。原文结论是：改权重能移除挡住能力的障碍，但加不了模型本来没有的能力。\n更像自动修 bug，还不是自我进化。", "url": "https://x.com/tiandidadacqqx/status/2117408786034119002"}, {"author_id": "1801260515014090752", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:07:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117408273536282783"], "id": "2117408273536282783", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 57, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@oran_ge 大模型直接改小模型权重、数学能力提六倍，这个方向比再堆训练数据更吓人，想看看可复现性怎么样。", "url": "https://x.com/_ExploreAI/status/2117408273536282783"}, {"author_id": "2254603412", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:07:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117408243584831728"], "id": "2117408243584831728", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 103, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@oran_ge 大模型幫小模型動手術 才動0.016% 這刀開得比外科醫生還準欸", "url": "https://x.com/Utopia6199/status/2117408243584831728"}, {"author_id": "336430573", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:05:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117407830433292710"], "id": "2117407830433292710", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 147, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@oran_ge 我看了下表，10 次和 25 次前向几乎没修好，撞 token 上限的还有 87%，给到 50 次才突然掉下来。更像带反馈的试错，不是看一眼权重就懂了", "url": "https://x.com/ak12kpoot/status/2117407830433292710"}, {"author_id": "1640237294551552000", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:04:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117407412437102612"], "id": "2117407412437102612", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 80, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@oran_ge 0.016%折合约12.8万个参数。小模型的数学分低，很多是\"推理循环\"这类失败模式拖的，修好它提升倍数会很大，但不等于能力上限变了；关键看没见过的题和其他基准有没有掉点。", "url": "https://x.com/zrqgood9068/status/2117407412437102612"}, {"author_id": "2007976461031096320", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:51:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117404376021274888"], "id": "2117404376021274888", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@oran_ge 补充一个澄清供参考：Haseeb Qureshi 说 Astra 是找到一个已发表的可解释性方法、自己实现了一遍，修掉了小模型推理时死循环的问题。六倍主要来自模型终于能把题做完，不是数学能力变强。方向确实有意思，但距离 RSI 还远。", "url": "https://x.com/zhuhaotian512/status/2117404376021274888"}, {"author_id": "1717809218731065344", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:39:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117401232675664012"], "id": "2117401232675664012", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@oran_ge 服了，训练都省了直接改权重。RSI 这回不是 PPT，是真动手了", "url": "https://x.com/libo_ai/status/2117401232675664012"}, {"author_id": "2114635415424749568", "conversation_id": "2117398931932082403", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:34:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117399983863550079"], "id": "2117399983863550079", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 143, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@oran_ge 只改了0.016%的权重就治好0.8B的推理死循环，小模型以后可能都靠大模型来修", "url": "https://x.com/RoadNaw9i/status/2117399983863550079"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "2116821087975837697", "name": "打工喵 Poppy", "username": "AIToolsDaily_CN"}, {"id": "1894341089886441473", "name": "hhh", "username": "goddarkness159"}, {"id": "2115649308448133120", "name": "遇灵枯木封甘", "username": "lilimg4614"}, {"id": "1336896006", "name": "阿强", "username": "BruceJia1"}, {"id": "2953739684", "name": "0xAzr", "username": "AzrianoY1"}, {"id": "15365930", "name": "xwh", "username": "xuwenhao"}, {"id": "1810658914926829568", "name": "小崽子AI｜AI工具实测", "username": "GANGDANwangw"}, {"id": "1400424921214242816", "name": "在DJANGO被狗咬的達太安", "username": "DavidNwohogan"}, {"id": "2066846388848308224", "name": "Jhon Dennis", "username": "JhonDennisxiud"}, {"id": "1544596823918067712", "name": "guyun｜出海 AI 实测", "username": "guyun_ai"}, {"id": "1693478330765656064", "name": "Edwin Kant", "username": "Waimingfung"}, {"id": "1880515510942695424", "name": "Byron Xiao", "username": "ByronXiao252982"}, {"id": "1136830981736947712", "name": "Jeree", "username": "Jeree12408242"}, {"id": "1820469501508644865", "name": "YGM", "username": "JACKYY218072"}, {"id": "564584308", "name": "Big Head(大头版)", "username": "bighead_datou"}, {"id": "2078125254615212033", "name": "俯仰｜AI 独立开发", "username": "tiandidadacqqx"}, {"id": "1801260515014090752", "name": "EAAI", "username": "_ExploreAI"}, {"id": "2254603412", "name": "Utopia", "username": "Utopia6199"}, {"id": "336430573", "name": "uber master", "username": "ak12kpoot"}, {"id": "1640237294551552000", "name": "zrqgood", "username": "zrqgood9068"}, {"id": "2007976461031096320", "name": "DeepInTheNight", "username": "zhuhaotian512"}, {"id": "1717809218731065344", "name": "AI速递 | 李博", "username": "libo_ai"}, {"id": "2114635415424749568", "name": "Road N", "username": "RoadNaw9i"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2117424728256483430", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyibing8w9agojm64xqs2xyuav1", "oldest_id": "2117399983863550079", "result_count": 23}}